<main>

<!-- ============ 1. PAGE HERO ============ -->
<section class="page-hero" data-screen-label="About - Hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>About Precision Roofing Alabama</h1>
    <p>Alabama's trusted, licensed &amp; insured roofing contractor for replacements, repairs, and storm-damage insurance claims. Built on honesty, quality, and a commitment to protecting your home.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 2. WHO ARE WE ============ -->
<section class="section whoweare" data-screen-label="About - Who We Are">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="wa-grid">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="wa-eyebrow">Who Are We?</span>
        <h2 class="wa-title">Alabama's Trusted<br>Roofing Contractor</h2>
        <div class="wa-copy">
          <p>At Precision Roofing Alabama, we're a locally owned and operated roofing company proudly serving homeowners across the entire State of Alabama. We specialize in roof replacements, repairs, and storm-damage restoration, delivering dependable solutions that protect, restore, and strengthen homes of every size.</p>
          <p>Whether it's a full architectural-shingle replacement, a stubborn leak, or hail and severe-storm damage, our crews are committed to quality craftsmanship and professional execution. We use premium, manufacturer-spec materials, proven installation methods, and maintain clear communication from start to finish.</p>
          <p>For homeowners, we focus on protecting your investment and your peace of mind, handling insurance claims directly with your adjuster so the process stays smooth, fair, and stress-free from inspection to final nail.</p>
          <p>At Precision Roofing Alabama, integrity, attention to detail, and doing the job right the first time aren't just promises. They're our standard.</p>
          <div class="wa-brand" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-top:26px;flex-wrap:wrap">
            <span style="display:inline-flex;background:#fff;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(9,31,46,.08)"><img src="assets/certainteed-logo.png" alt="CertainTeed Saint-Gobain" style="height:36px;width:auto;display:block"></span>
            <p style="margin:0">Proud installer of CertainTeed roofing products.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="wa-card reveal">
        <div class="wa-list">
          <div class="wa-item">
            <svg class="wa-ck" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
            <h4>Honest Communication</h4>
            <p>No surprises. No hidden costs. We provide clear estimates, detailed scopes of work, and keep you informed from start to finish.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="wa-item">
            <svg class="wa-ck" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
            <h4>Free, No-Pressure Inspections</h4>
            <p>Complimentary roof inspections with honest findings and clear photos, so you know exactly what your roof needs and what it doesn't.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="wa-item">
            <svg class="wa-ck" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
            <h4>Financing Options Available</h4>
            <p>Flexible financing for all budgets so a new roof can fit your finances. Ask about current plans and terms during your free estimate.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="wa-item">
            <svg class="wa-ck" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
            <h4>We Treat Your Home Like Our Own</h4>
            <p>Clean job sites, respectful crews, protected landscaping, and attention to detail, because your home deserves the very best.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 3a. STATS BAND ============ -->
<section class="stats-band" data-screen-label="About - Stats">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="stats-row">
      <div class="stat-i reveal">
        <div class="stat-n" id="statN1">100+</div>
        <div class="stat-l">Roofs Completed</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-i reveal">
        <div class="stat-n" id="statN2">10+</div>
        <div class="stat-l">Years Experience</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-i reveal">
        <div class="stat-n"><span id="statN3">5</span><span class="star">★</span></div>
        <div class="stat-l">Customer Rating</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 3c. OWNER SPOTLIGHT ============ -->
<section class="section owners" data-screen-label="About - Owner Spotlight">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="own-head reveal">
      <span class="own-eyebrow">Owner Spotlight</span>
      <h2>Meet The Owners</h2>
      <p>Two co-owners, one standard. Every job we take on runs through both of them, from the first inspection to the final nail.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="own-grid">
      <!-- NOTE: swap this bio for the Facebook Owner Spotlight copy when ready -->
      <article class="own-card reveal">
        <div class="own-photo"><img src="assets/photos/owner-cary.jpg" alt="Cary Dean, Co-Owner of Precision Roofing Alabama" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="own-body">
          <span class="own-role">Co-Owner</span>
          <h3>Cary Dean</h3>
          <p>Every roof starts with a conversation, and for most of our customers that conversation starts with Cary. Our Co-Owner is the one who shows up for the free inspection, explains the process in plain English, and stays with the job through the final walkthrough.</p>
          <p>Homeowners keep using the same words for him in their reviews: helpful, down to earth, easy to talk to. He is just as comfortable on a roof as he is across the table from an insurance adjuster, which is how Precision Roofing Alabama built its reputation for handling storm damage claims without the runaround.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="own-card reveal">
        <div class="own-photo"><img src="assets/photos/owner-will.jpg" alt="Will Thornton, Co-Owner of Precision Roofing Alabama" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="own-body">
          <span class="own-role">Co-Owner</span>
          <h3>Will Thornton</h3>
          <p>Every successful company needs two things: a brain for business and a real foundation of experience in the industry. Will is where those two meet. He brings over 7 years of hands-on construction experience to Precision Roofing Alabama, and there is not a job on a roof he has not done himself before asking a crew to do it.</p>
          <p>He loves being his own boss because it lets him build a business that goes above and beyond for its clients, its employees, and its community. In practice that means crews that show up when they said they would, details that do not get skipped, and a homeowner who gets a straight answer even when the answer is that the roof can wait.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 3b. PROCESS ============ -->
<section class="section aproc" data-screen-label="About - Process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="ap-eyebrow reveal">How We Work</span>
    <h2 class="reveal">Our Process</h2>
    <p class="ap-sub reveal">From first contact to final walkthrough, we make the experience seamless.</p>
    <div class="proc-timeline">
      <div class="proc-step reveal">
        <div class="proc-top"><span class="proc-num">01</span></div>
        <h4>Free Inspection</h4>
        <p>We assess your roof's condition with a thorough, no-obligation inspection. Honest findings, no pressure.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="proc-step reveal">
        <div class="proc-top"><span class="proc-num">02</span></div>
        <h4>Detailed Estimate</h4>
        <p>Transparent pricing with a clear scope of work. No hidden fees, no surprises, just a fair, itemized quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="proc-step reveal">
        <div class="proc-top"><span class="proc-num">03</span></div>
        <h4>Expert Installation</h4>
        <p>Our professional crew handles every detail using premium materials and proven techniques.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="proc-step reveal">
        <div class="proc-top"><span class="proc-num">04</span></div>
        <h4>Final Walkthrough</h4>
        <p>We don't leave until you're satisfied. A complete walkthrough ensures everything meets our standards, and yours.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 4. FINAL CTA ============ -->
<section class="endcta" data-screen-label="About - CTA">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Ready to Get Started?</h2>
    <p>Schedule your free roof inspection today. No obligation, no pressure, just an honest assessment from a team you can trust.</p>
    <a href="index.html#contact" class="btn btn-light btn-lg">Schedule Free Inspection</a>
  </div>
</section>

